#X obj 675 8 flow.less;
#X obj 230 78 cnv 1 535 210 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -237178 -1 0;
#X text 240 83 the object routes the incoming numbers to the outlets
according to the threshold values: a number that is less than the first
value goes to the first outlet \, a number less than the N-th value
goes to the N-th outlet;
#X text 240 153 numbers greater than or equal to the last threshold
value are sent to the last outlet;
#X text 240 193 the threshold values must be in ascending order;
#X text 240 218 the object can be used to split a numeric stream into
ranges \, for example to map note pitches to different instruments
or to divide a sensor range into zones;
